        "text": "<thinking> To create the `extract_json.py` file that calls a hosted LLM to extract structured JSON from text, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I will use Amazon Bedrock, which is a suitable choice for this task. The code will include the necessary imports and a function that makes a call to the Amazon Bedrock API to extract JSON from text. </thinking>\n",
